{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ae62d0a846dc900947f21f0c3ebe8ed43c280528158480a19b91fde0c93a47ac", "ja": "（ジュリアと美希が、双子星のお姫様になって、\nテーマパークを盛り上げた。お客さんも喜んでたな！）", "zh": "（茱莉亚和美希变成了双子星的公主，让主题乐园热闹了起来。游客们也都很开心啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1001_p", "source_sha256": "fc47132f945d6c77d3e65846c1fc4dd690070f0b8280d452fa12cfc3c6723506", "ja": "お疲れ様、ふたりとも。\nふたりのおかげで、すごく盛り上がったよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，你们两个。\n多亏了你们，现场热闹极了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "22088812852b2c89a9591c3db55669d606f9ca4cd5837838b76b0d4ab8f2bd59", "ja": "聞いて聞いて、{$P$}！\nジュリアってば、すっごくモテモテだったの！", "zh": "听我说听我说，{$P$}！茱莉亚可受欢迎了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "ebf466228da463746e16e06548696ff7ceb09deb283d71da1fdedf73e9ddc5d9", "ja": "は、はぁ！？　それは美希の方だろ？\nあたしがモテモテだったのは、その……。", "zh": "啊、啊！？那明明是美希吧？\n我之所以那么受欢迎，是因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "90fe9dcfa58781a9353affa1d5e2326434eaa783454c7d1b0440216a5c3616d3", "ja": "ミキ、見ちゃったんだ♪　たくさんのお客さんに\n「ファンになりました！」って言われてたの。", "zh": "美希看到了哦♪　好多观众都对你说\n“我成了你的粉丝！”呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "be6b87692083277ced812dfe8bda598500d64d60a4d8a1d2b779867f7887ed2d", "ja": "それにー。パレードが終わったあとも、\n男の子にプロポーズされてるの聞いちゃった♪", "zh": "而且——游行结束后，我还听到有个男孩子向你求婚了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "e69fc0b5e8c757fbb326739c55649f75818321d294fc2749c036435bada80dbd", "ja": "あっ、あれは！　プロポーズっていうか、\nそんなちゃんとしたものじゃなくて……。", "zh": "啊，那个嘛！与其说是求婚，其实没那么正式……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8dc6e04cca4e556f6bd5eef12677a139a1c6a9cc93814d673968a3e86209a0d9", "ja": "へぇ、すごいモテモテだったんだな。\nちなみに、そのプロポーズに何て答えたんだ？", "zh": "哎，原来你当时很受欢迎啊。\n顺便问一下，你对那次求婚是怎么回答的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "85d9d70132cfe5ca4517c0409956c5febf89fc9ad7f331a834f05974627e548b", "ja": "だからプロポーズじゃないって！　「お姉さんみたいな\nお姫様と結婚したい」って言われただけで……。", "zh": "所以都说了不是求婚嘛！　只是被说“想和像姐姐一样的公主结婚”而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1f5dd08f332d154464bfe737de96c2bb1f5f457e7d5c65e66eea12c7f072b648", "ja": "なるほど。でもその子は、本気でお姫様みたいだって\n思ったから、ジュリアに声をかけたんだよな？", "zh": "原来如此。不过，那孩子是因为真心觉得茱莉亚像公主，才主动搭话的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "46ce38d1ec056d0d36d7272a4c2e56f5ddcd7f187a2796058a1591b8d1480ef9", "ja": "そ、そう……なのか？　それなら美希だって、\n同じお姫様の衣装だし、あたしより似合ってるだろ。", "zh": "是、是这样吗……？那样的话，美希也是同样的公主装扮，肯定比我更适合吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "5035f973e987ae3b98a6228681abd32d1b5f463cc5250786251fb5bcbc1666a4", "ja": "ミキはもちろんカワイイけど、ジュリアもすっごく\nカワイイの。みんな、ドキドキしてたって思うな♪", "zh": "美希当然很可爱，不过，茱莉亚也超级\n可爱。我觉得大家都看得心动不已了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "92e891febc310a54e7b45858213f5657d6473d7112713d5c996930816210a127", "ja": "男の子がプロポーズしちゃうくらい、魅力的なの。\nそうだよね、{$P$}？", "zh": "魅力十足到连男孩子都会忍不住求婚呢。\n对吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a8874fc991bf3a07a0e05e947a320f426310573418a4b65a72a60318512f8b55", "ja": "ああ、美希の言うとおりだ。ジュリアも美希も、\nそれぞれの魅力で、お客さんを魅了してたよ。", "zh": "啊，正如美希所说。茱莉亚和美希，都凭借各自的魅力吸引了观众。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "0676a011544f9da66e2d5bb6acec5a8f9a4f9070c5d52fafe9396f45c0cb7b33", "ja": "……ふたりがそう言うなら。でもフリフリの衣装とか\nプロポーズとか、なんだか今日は落ち着かないな……。", "zh": "……既然你们两个都这么说。不过又是花里胡哨的服装又是\n求婚什么的，总觉得今天怎么也静不下心来啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "16c1236a92742584a7ab575d9f710ae0818e4a97a8f07d85a26f24d8668922f9", "ja": "そう？　ミキはどっちもうれしいの。\n{$P$}、ミキの準備はバッチリなの☆", "zh": "是吗？美希觉得这两件事都很开心呢。\n{$P$}，美希已经准备得妥妥的了☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "7889c391544ff4a88b639d76ea64cdd360f1544d06ac61b335f7f230e9498b5b", "ja": "えっ！？　美希の準備って……\nあんた、プロデュースしてるアイドルに……まさか！？", "zh": "诶！？　美希的准备是……\n你该不会对自己制作的偶像……难道！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1018_p", "source_sha256": "3b8716f8cf2d7c55e4d6f3f7b25ec49ad8f404c407ad4af383463f00403235e3", "ja": "ジュ、ジュリア！？　違う、それは勘違いだ！\nほら、美希。ジュリアに説明を……。", "zh": "朱、茱莉亚！？不，不是那回事！这是误会！你看，美希。向茱莉亚解释一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "a1949ff63631352369d8dfbafe1fad9d827fb6b3f6c1e0df41c1dac3c831d4b6", "ja": "なんで怒ってるの、ジュリア？\nもしかしてジュリアも、プロポーズしてもらいたいの？", "zh": "为什么生气啊，茱莉亚？  \n难道说，茱莉亚也想被求婚吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "f4270e5e21730ca978f5030cfd95c2c49a08444b9f2f952c3aa57d4eebfe1a5f", "ja": "なんでそうなるんだよ！\nそうじゃなくて……今はバカPを。ああ～、もう！", "zh": "才不是那么回事！  \n不是那个……我现在说的是笨蛋P……啊～真是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0354_1021_p", "source_sha256": "05d39c9f4ff90c5f951fc273c4aef3ceb5509ad14e38faed2913516929c16007", "ja": "（ジュリアと美希、真逆に見えていいコンビかもしれ\nない。……それより、ジュリアの誤解をとかないと）", "zh": "（茱莉亚和美希看起来性格完全相反，说不定反而是很合拍的一对搭档。……不对，得先解开茱莉亚的误会才行）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
